  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:06.190" end="00:10.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(The world is yours)</p>
      <p begin="00:10.310" end="00:13.940" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:13.940" end="00:16.400" ttm:agent="v1">Like, shit, fuck, damn, hold up, wait just a minute</p>
      <p begin="00:16.400" end="00:18.360" ttm:agent="v1">Too much money, pockets can't fit it</p>
      <p begin="00:18.360" end="00:20.200" ttm:agent="v1">Four, five shots, this MAC got no limit</p>
      <p begin="00:20.200" end="00:21.970" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch call me, said she want to visit</p>
      <p begin="00:21.970" end="00:23.590" ttm:agent="v1">Come through, bitch, fuck you</p>
      <p begin="00:23.590" end="00:25.450" ttm:agent="v1">Ten racks my kicks, like Kung-Fu</p>
      <p begin="00:25.450" end="00:27.000" ttm:agent="v1">Want beef, then I hit 'em with the one, two</p>
      <p begin="00:27.000" end="00:28.820" ttm:agent="v1">One, two shots to your dome, now you're done soon</p>
      <p begin="00:28.820" end="00:31.300" ttm:agent="v1">Like, shit, fuck, damn, hold up, wait just a minute</p>
      <p begin="00:31.300" end="00:33.020" ttm:agent="v1">Too much money, pockets can't fit it</p>
      <p begin="00:33.020" end="00:34.820" ttm:agent="v1">Four, five shots, this MAC got no limit</p>
      <p begin="00:34.820" end="00:36.710" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch call me, said she want to visit</p>
      <p begin="00:36.710" end="00:38.340" ttm:agent="v1">Come through, bitch, fuck you</p>
      <p begin="00:38.340" end="00:40.160" ttm:agent="v1">Ten racks my kicks, like Kung-Fu</p>
      <p begin="00:40.160" end="00:41.800" ttm:agent="v1">Want beef, then I hit 'em with the one, two</p>
      <p begin="00:41.800" end="00:44.630" ttm:agent="v1">One, two shots to your dome, now you're done soon, done soon, bitch</p>
      <p begin="00:44.630" end="00:46.230" ttm:agent="v1">We don't make music, we talk shit</p>
      <p begin="00:46.230" end="00:48.060" ttm:agent="v1">Bad bitch from thе party finna pop shit</p>
      <p begin="00:48.060" end="00:49.830" ttm:agent="v1">Emo bitch 'cause I been with the rock shit</p>
      <p begin="00:49.830" end="00:52.170" ttm:agent="v1">Tell mе what the fuck is this nonsense, damn</p>
      <p begin="00:52.170" end="00:53.710" ttm:agent="v1">Got ten on the 'Gram, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:53.710" end="00:55.500" ttm:agent="v1">But he don't got ten in his hand</p>
      <p begin="00:55.500" end="00:57.000" ttm:agent="v1">Talk down, but you been a fan</p>
      <p begin="00:56.750" end="00:58.780" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I been somewhere you don't wanna ever stand</p>
      <p begin="00:58.780" end="01:00.590" ttm:agent="v1">I got plugs in state, I might fly to Atlanta</p>
      <p begin="01:00.590" end="01:02.460" ttm:agent="v1">Three hoes at the crib, bitch, I feel like Santa</p>
      <p begin="01:02.460" end="01:04.250" ttm:agent="v1">Bruce Lee, kick flippin', I'm goin' bananas</p>
      <p begin="01:04.250" end="01:06.040" ttm:agent="v1">Kick a bitch out quit, I don't got no manners</p>
      <p begin="01:06.040" end="01:07.950" ttm:agent="v1">She's so damn bad, but she not for me</p>
      <p begin="01:07.950" end="01:09.750" ttm:agent="v1">Chained down, neck tat, red eyes, I'm green</p>
      <p begin="01:09.750" end="01:11.680" ttm:agent="v1">Girl's toxic as fuck, wonder what she sees</p>
      <p begin="01:11.680" end="01:13.550" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, real bitch, she for real, just like me</p>
      <p begin="01:13.550" end="01:15.320" ttm:agent="v1">And she just like me, go bestie, go</p>
      <p begin="01:15.320" end="01:17.080" ttm:agent="v1">I can't deal with no friendly hoe</p>
      <p begin="01:17.080" end="01:19.020" ttm:agent="v1">So bad, might take her to Mexico</p>
      <p begin="01:19.020" end="01:20.830" ttm:agent="v1">If you're ready to leave, then just let me know</p>
      <p begin="01:20.830" end="01:22.840" ttm:agent="v1">This fit right here, it cost me a rent day</p>
      <p begin="01:22.840" end="01:24.770" ttm:agent="v1">Busy getting money, I don't care what the rest say</p>
      <p begin="01:24.770" end="01:26.480" ttm:agent="v1">Talk to me short, I'ma leave yo' ass stretch day</p>
      <p begin="01:26.480" end="01:28.400" ttm:agent="v1">Leave her walkin' out like she just hit leg day</p>
      <p begin="01:28.400" end="01:30.290" ttm:agent="v1">Zoey 101, are you ready?</p>
      <p begin="01:30.290" end="01:32.020" ttm:agent="v1">Pistol by my side, it get heavy</p>
      <p begin="01:32.020" end="01:33.730" ttm:agent="v1">Whip the new Porsche like an old-school Chevy</p>
      <p begin="01:33.730" end="01:35.680" ttm:agent="v1">They steal all my flows and they actin' so friendly</p>
      <p begin="01:35.680" end="01:37.580" ttm:agent="v1">I swear y'all a joke, but that shit isn't funny</p>
      <p begin="01:37.580" end="01:39.300" ttm:agent="v1">You copy my looks, but you're still lookin' bummy</p>
      <p begin="01:39.300" end="01:41.200" ttm:agent="v1">The flow like the drip of the nose 'cause it's runny</p>
      <p begin="01:41.200" end="01:42.760" ttm:agent="v1">My bitch know my songs, so she bounce like a bunny</p>
      <p begin="01:42.760" end="01:45.040" ttm:agent="v1">Like, shit, fuck, damn, hold up, wait just a minute</p>
      <p begin="01:45.040" end="01:46.870" ttm:agent="v1">Too much money, pockets can't fit it</p>
      <p begin="01:46.870" end="01:48.720" ttm:agent="v1">Four, five shots, this MAC got no limit</p>
      <p begin="01:48.720" end="01:50.660" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch call me, said she want to visit</p>
      <p begin="01:50.660" end="01:52.250" ttm:agent="v1">Come through, bitch, fuck you</p>
      <p begin="01:52.250" end="01:54.080" ttm:agent="v1">Ten racks my kicks, like Kung-Fu</p>
      <p begin="01:54.080" end="01:55.680" ttm:agent="v1">Want beef, then I hit 'em with the one, two</p>
      <p begin="01:55.680" end="01:57.570" ttm:agent="v1">One, two shots to your dome, now you're done soon</p>
      <p begin="01:57.570" end="01:59.870" ttm:agent="v1">Like, shit, fuck, damn, hold up, wait just a minute</p>
      <p begin="01:59.870" end="02:01.660" ttm:agent="v1">Too much money, pockets can't fit it</p>
